%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a53ee3976b5135c4e9247ce665451ab3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ilustrasi_3_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: This is today memory
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Years passed. My best friend and I made it to high school together.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: College was just around the corner, but a quiet terror started growing
        inside me.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: I felt hollow. I was living behind a mask with no real emotion left.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: But part of me was curious
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: I wanted to tell her the truth about who I really was.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: 'She was always like my parents: warm, supportive, always smiling.'
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: But what if she was just using me too?
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Would she still care about me if she saw how broken I actually am?
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: 'Every time she asked if I was okay, im just smile and said: ''I''m
        fine.'
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Maybe deep down, she knew I was lying. Maybe that's why she kept
        asking.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: ...
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: Then came the day of the university entrance results.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: She got accepted into her dream school right away.
      onLeft: 0
    - name: Rana
      leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
      rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
      sentence: "She even teased me, saying I\u2019d definitely pass too because
        I was 'so smart' and that's why she loved being my friend."
      onLeft: 0
